{
  "_comment": [
    "Everything tools/build_kit.py downloads to assemble a kit. Nothing here is committed to git.",
    "tier: small | medium | large (a tier includes all lower tiers). optional: only with --with-<id>.",
    "sha256/size: pinned content. null = not pinned yet; run `python3 tools/build_kit.py --lock` on a",
    "  trusted, networked machine, review the diff and commit it. --frozen (used by CI) refuses unpinned items.",
    "verified_url: false = URL written from the publisher's naming scheme but not fetched yet; --lock confirms it.",
    "replaces: ids of lower-tier items this one supersedes (e.g. WikiMed maxi replaces WikiMed mini).",
    "redistributable: false = may be built for personal use but must never be published (publish_gcs.py refuses)."
  ],
